---
config:
  look: classic
  theme: default
  flowchart:
    curve: basis
    wrappingWidth: 260
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client browser
    participant L as Local DNS resolver
    participant D as CDN authoritative DNS
    participant E as Nearest edge server
    participant O as Origin server
    C->>L: resolve images.example.com
    L->>D: query (CNAME points to the CDN)
    D-->>L: IP of the replica closest to the resolver
    L-->>C: edge server IP
    C->>E: GET /images/logo.png
    alt cached at the edge
        E-->>C: object from cache
    else cache miss
        E->>O: fetch object
        O-->>E: object
        E-->>C: object, now cached
    end
